[2026-04-14] ## Kotitreeni vauvan kanssa
Derived strength.neural_stress 35|score basis:entity confidence:85% source:bodyweight goodness:4
Derived strength.strength_endurance_emphasis 45|score basis:entity confidence:80% source:reps goodness:4
